{"3333190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Road Truckers: New Beginning", "steam_appid": 3333190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the forgotten country of Vale Rico, the roads are cracked, the storefronts faded, and hope is in short supply. <strong>But you have the horsepower to save it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world's first Trucking RPG.</strong> A journey where your deliveries don't just earn you money - they rebuild a community, restore an economy, and create a legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver More Than Cargo. Deliver Hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job isn't to haul goods to a nameless depot. You're delivering the very materials that will mend this broken land. See the world change with key deliveries, as dusty, neglected buildings get a new coat of paint, dormant businesses roar back to life, and the central monument of your town is restored, piece by piece. In Road Truckers, your impact is real, and it's visible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/d011a9df8abd5d30d1bc32f3f649e429.poster.avif?t=1787759094\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/d011a9df8abd5d30d1bc32f3f649e429.webm?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/d011a9df8abd5d30d1bc32f3f649e429.mp4?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Trucker, Not Just a Truck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most important part of any journey is the stops along the way. Park your rig, step out of the cab, and explore the world on your own two feet. Walk into a store for supplies, grab a bite at a roadside stand, or visit the junkyard to scout for rare parts. Forge relationships, manage your own needs, and experience a level of immersion that goes far beyond the highway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/067e26fa6195bcb9935635b660978328.poster.avif?t=1787759094\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/067e26fa6195bcb9935635b660978328.webm?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/067e26fa6195bcb9935635b660978328.mp4?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Rig, Your Legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a true RPG, your progression matters. Your truck is your trusted companion or your primary tool for change. Dive into a deep customization system where you can overhaul your rig’s appearance and fine-tune its performance. Upgrade your engine for more hauling power, tune your suspension to conquer treacherous jungle roads, and create a visual style that’s uniquely yours. From the engine block to the dashboard figurines, build a rig that tells your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/c3835573677e6d0117701af2ab75a121.poster.avif?t=1787759094\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/c3835573677e6d0117701af2ab75a121.webm?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/c3835573677e6d0117701af2ab75a121.mp4?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Trucking Business.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every legend needs a base of operations. Take over a forgotten, derelict airstrip and transform it into the thriving heart of your trucking business. Build and upgrade specialized workstations to unlock advanced repair and customization options. Investing in your community pays you back, with local businesses generating income that fuels your journey to becoming the most respected trucker in Vale Rico.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/1a4be2c8c39d0385fd735424d763f1b0.poster.avif?t=1787759094\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/1a4be2c8c39d0385fd735424d763f1b0.webm?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333190/extras/1a4be2c8c39d0385fd735424d763f1b0.mp4?t=1787759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Journey Awaits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore an Open World:</strong> Make a tangible impact on the economy and see the environment change based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Life:</strong> Get on foot to eat, sleep, and interact with a cast of memorable characters and quest-givers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong> Build your dream truck with extensive mechanical and visual upgrades that define your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Business:</strong> Grow your own trucking business from a dusty airstrip into a powerhouse of logistics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Journey:</strong> Enjoy a beautiful South American-inspired landscape with a full day-night cycle and dynamic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Legend:</strong> Your choices matter. Your deliveries have meaning. Your legacy starts now.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is calling. Wishlist Road Truckers: New Beginning today.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the forgotten country of Vale Rico, the roads are cracked, the storefronts faded, and hope is in short supply. <strong>But you have the horsepower to save it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world's first Trucking RPG.</strong> A journey where your deliveries don't just earn you money - they rebuild a community, restore an economy, and create a legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver More Than Cargo. Deliver Hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job isn't to haul goods to a nameless depot. You're delivering the very materials that will mend this broken land. See the world change with key deliveries, as dusty, neglected buildings get a new coat of paint, dormant businesses roar back to life, and the central monument of your town is restored, piece by piece. In Road Truckers, your impact is real, and it's visible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autop